<BlogPost
  slug="formspree-vs-netlify-forms"
  title="Formspree vs Netlify Forms (2026): a fair comparison"
  description="Both Formspree and Netlify Forms handle form submissions for static and Jamstack sites — but they're built on different assumptions. Here's the honest tradeoff: when each one fits, when each one breaks, and what else to consider."
  publishedAt="2026-05-16"
  updatedAt="2026-05-16"
